<!doctype html>
{# DDX-ES, explained: built into docs/explainer.pdf by scripts/build_explainer.py; numbers come from results/*.json #}
{% macro arr(cls="") %}<span class="arr {{ cls }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 12" width="20" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 6h15M12 2l5 4-5 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>{% endmacro %}
{% macro analogy(body) %}<div class="analogy"><span class="tag">Analogy</span>{{ body }}</div>{% endmacro %}
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>DDX-ES, explained</title>
<style>
{{ fonts }}
:root {
  --blue: #01416B; --gold: #FDD402; --darkgold: #C99A00; --amber: #8A6100; --cream: #FFF4CC; --ink: #1F2D3A;
  --muted: #5E6E7E; --tint: #E6EEF5; --line: #C9D6E3; --red: #B42318; --redtint: #FBE4E1; --green: #1E6E3E;
  --greentint: #E3F2E8; --codebg: #F3F6F9; --lav: #EFE8F7; --purple: #5B3A8E;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
body { margin: 0; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); font: 9.8pt/1.5 'Work Sans', sans-serif; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', serif; color: var(--blue); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0; }
h2 { font-size: 16.5pt; margin: 22pt 0 4pt; break-after: avoid; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 9pt; }
h2 .n { font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: var(--blue);
  border-radius: 50%; width: 19pt; height: 19pt; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  flex: none; position: relative; top: -2pt; }
h3 { font-size: 11.5pt; margin: 12pt 0 3pt; break-after: avoid; }
p { margin: 0 0 6pt; orphans: 3; widows: 3; }
ul { margin: 0 0 6pt; padding-left: 14pt; }
li { margin-bottom: 3pt; }
li::marker { color: var(--blue); }
code, .mono { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.6pt; }
b, strong { font-weight: 700; }
.g { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; }
.lead { font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0 0 8pt; break-inside: avoid; break-after: avoid; }
.intro { break-inside: avoid; }
section.newpage { break-before: page; }
section.newpage h2 { margin-top: 0; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.small { font-size: 8.6pt; }
section { break-inside: auto; }
.keep { break-inside: avoid; }

/* title block */
.title { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 14pt; align-items: start; border-bottom: 3pt solid var(--gold);
  padding-bottom: 12pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; }
.kicker { font-size: 8.6pt; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; }
.title h1 { font-size: 30pt; margin: 4pt 0 6pt; }
.title .sub { font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.4; max-width: 125mm; }
.title .meta { font-size: 8.4pt; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8pt; line-height: 1.45; }
.title img { width: 30mm; }
.howto { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; }
.box { background: var(--tint); border-radius: 7pt; padding: 9pt 12pt; }
.box h3 { margin-top: 0; }
.toc { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.3; }
.toc li { margin: 0 0 2pt; }
.toc span { display: inline-block; width: 16pt; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; }

/* analogy */
.analogy { background: var(--cream); border-left: 4pt solid var(--darkgold); border-radius: 0 7pt 7pt 0; padding: 8pt 12pt;
  margin: 2pt 0 10pt; font-size: 10.3pt; line-height: 1.45; break-inside: avoid; }
.analogy .tag { display: block; font-size: 7.8pt; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 1pt; }
.analogies { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; }
.analogies .analogy { margin: 0; font-size: 9.4pt; }

/* diagrams */
figure { margin: 4pt 0 12pt; break-inside: avoid; }
figcaption { font-size: 8.2pt; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 5pt; line-height: 1.4; }
figure img { width: 100%; display: block; }
figure img.framed { border: .75pt solid var(--line); border-radius: 4pt; }
.flow { display: flex; align-items: stretch; }
.arr { flex: none; width: 20pt; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--muted); }
.arr.gold { color: var(--darkgold); }
.arr.down { width: auto; height: 16pt; }
.arr.down svg { transform: rotate(90deg); }
.node { flex: 1; border-radius: 7pt; padding: 7pt 9pt; background: var(--tint); font-size: 8.6pt; line-height: 1.38; }
.node > b:first-child { display: block; color: var(--blue); font-size: 9.6pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; }
.node.blue { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
.node.blue > b:first-child { color: #fff; }
.node.cream { background: var(--cream); }
.node.cream > b:first-child { color: var(--amber); }
.node.green { background: var(--greentint); }
.node.green > b:first-child { color: var(--green); }
.node.white { background: #fff; border: .75pt solid var(--line); }
.node.lav { background: var(--lav); }
.node.lav > b:first-child { color: var(--purple); }
.node.red { background: var(--redtint); }
.node.red > b:first-child { color: var(--red); }
.node.center { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; }
.stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6pt; flex: 1; }

/* section 1 overview */
.overview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 20pt .9fr 20pt 1fr; align-items: center; }
.overview .stack .node { flex: none; }

/* dataset split bar */
.split { display: flex; height: 26pt; border-radius: 5pt; overflow: hidden; font-size: 8.4pt; font-weight: 700; }
.split div { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; }
.split div:first-child { color: #fff; }
.split-labels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12pt; font-size: 8.4pt; line-height: 1.38;
  margin-top: 6pt; }
.split-labels i { display: inline-block; width: 8pt; height: 8pt; border-radius: 2pt; margin-right: 4pt;
  vertical-align: -0.5pt; }

/* tiles */
.tiles { display: grid; gap: 8pt; margin: 4pt 0 10pt; break-inside: avoid; }
.tiles.t4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
.tiles.t3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
.tiles.t2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
.tile { background: var(--tint); border-radius: 7pt; padding: 7pt 10pt; }
.tile .num { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); line-height: 1.15; }
.tile .lab { font-size: 8.2pt; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.3; }
.tile.green { background: var(--greentint); } .tile.green .num { color: var(--green); }
.tile.red { background: var(--redtint); } .tile.red .num { color: var(--red); }
.tile.cream { background: var(--cream); } .tile.cream .num { color: var(--amber); }
.tile.grey { background: var(--codebg); } .tile.grey .num { color: var(--muted); }

/* tables */
table.t { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 8.6pt; margin: 2pt 0 10pt; break-inside: avoid; }
table.t th { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; padding: 4pt 7pt; }
table.t td { padding: 3.5pt 7pt; border-bottom: .75pt solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
table.t tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #F7F9FB; }
table.t .r { text-align: right; } table.t .c { text-align: center; }

/* relay chain */
.relay { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); column-gap: 14pt; row-gap: 6pt; position: relative; }
.relay .head { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-radius: 7pt; padding: 6pt 8pt; font-size: 8.4pt; line-height: 1.3;
  position: relative; }
.relay .head b { display: block; font-size: 9.6pt; }
.relay .head .cnt { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
.relay .head:not(:nth-child(5))::after { content: "▶"; position: absolute; right: -12pt; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
  color: var(--darkgold); font-size: 8pt; }
.relay .ex { background: var(--cream); border-radius: 7pt; padding: 6pt 8pt; font-size: 8.3pt; line-height: 1.35; }
.relay .ex b { display: block; color: var(--amber); font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.4pt; }

/* phases */
.phases { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8pt; }
.phase { background: var(--tint); border-radius: 7pt; padding: 8pt 9pt; font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 1.38; position: relative; }
.phase .d { font-weight: 700; color: var(--amber); font-size: 8pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
.phase b.t { display: block; font-size: 10pt; color: var(--blue); margin: 1pt 0 3pt; }
.phase .stat { margin-top: 5pt; padding-top: 5pt; border-top: .75pt solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 8.1pt; }

/* odds scale */
.scale { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 3pt; text-align: center; font-size: 8.4pt; }
.scale div { border-radius: 5pt; padding: 5pt 2pt; }
.scale .cf { font-weight: 700; font-size: 10pt; }
.scale .x { font-size: 8.4pt; }
.formula { font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', serif; font-size: 10pt; background: var(--codebg); border: .75pt solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 6pt; padding: 6pt 10pt; margin: 4pt 0 8pt; break-inside: avoid; }

/* triage levels */
.lvl { display: inline-block; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4pt; padding: 1pt 7pt; font-size: 8.4pt; }
.lvl.e { background: var(--red); } .lvl.u { background: var(--amber); } .lvl.n { background: var(--blue); }
.lvl.s { background: var(--green); }
.sev { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 22pt auto; gap: 4pt 2pt; align-items: center; justify-content: start;
  font-size: 8.4pt; margin-top: 4pt; }

/* steps (worked example) */
.steps { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; counter-reset: s; }
.steps li { counter-increment: s; position: relative; padding: 0 0 7pt 26pt; margin: 0; break-inside: avoid; }
.steps li::before { content: counter(s); position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 17pt; height: 17pt; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 8.5pt; display: flex; align-items: center;
  justify-content: center; }
.steps li:last-child::before { background: var(--red); }
.steps li b { color: var(--blue); }
.two { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; gap: 14pt; align-items: start; }
.two.even { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }

/* code */
pre { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.4pt; line-height: 1.5; background: var(--codebg);
  border: .75pt solid var(--line); border-radius: 6pt; padding: 8pt 10pt; margin: 4pt 0 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap;
  break-inside: avoid; }
pre .c { color: var(--muted); }

/* ethics */
.ethics { background: var(--redtint); border-radius: 7pt; padding: 9pt 12pt; break-inside: avoid; }
.ethics b:first-child { color: var(--red); }

/* glossary */
.glossary { columns: 2; column-gap: 18pt; margin: 4pt 0 0; }
.glossary div { break-inside: avoid; margin: 0 0 8pt; font-size: 9.6pt; line-height: 1.42; }
.glossary dt { font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); display: inline; }
.glossary dd { display: inline; margin: 0; }
.glossary .ref { color: var(--muted); font-size: 7.8pt; white-space: nowrap; }
svg text { font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="title">
  <div>
    <div class="kicker">Companion guide · Sistem Pakar Lanjut final project</div>
    <h1>DDX-ES, explained</h1>
    <div class="sub">A plain-language guide to an explainable knowledge-graph expert system for differential diagnosis
      and triage, with an analogy and a diagram for every idea, and a glossary at the end.</div>
    <div class="meta">Program Studi Magister Kecerdasan Artifisial · Departemen Ilmu Komputer dan Elektronika ·
      FMIPA Universitas Gadjah Mada · November 2026<br>Code and data: github.com/zidanarsyad/ddx-expert-system</div>
  </div>
  <img src="{{ fig['ugm-logo'] }}" alt="Universitas Gadjah Mada">
</header>

<div class="howto">
  <div class="box">
    <h3>How to read this guide</h3>
    <p>Each section explains one idea in three layers. The yellow <b>analogy</b> box gives the idea in everyday terms.
      The <b>diagram</b> shows how it works. The text then says what DDX-ES actually does, with the real numbers from
      the evaluation.</p>
    <p style="margin:0">Words in <span class="g">blue bold</span> are defined in the glossary (section 16). The
      report has the full method and the references; the slides are the talk. This guide is for understanding.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="box" style="background:#fff;border:.75pt solid var(--line)">
    <h3>Contents</h3>
    <ol class="toc">
      <li><span>1</span>The project in one minute</li>
      <li><span>2</span>The data: DDXPlus</li>
      <li><span>3</span>Where the knowledge comes from</li>
      <li><span>4</span>The knowledge graph</li>
      <li><span>5</span>The rules</li>
      <li><span>6</span>The inference engine</li>
      <li><span>7</span>Certainty factors</li>
      <li><span>8</span>Triage</li>
      <li><span>9</span>The consultation</li>
      <li><span>10</span>Explanations</li>
      <li><span>11</span>Provenance</li>
