<h2><span class="n">5</span>The rules</h2>
<p class="lead">DDX-ES has {{ n_rules }} IF–THEN rules of five kinds. Each carries a certainty factor, its source and
  its mapping fidelity.</p>
{{ analogy("A relay race. Each kind of rule runs one leg and hands the baton to the next: answers become clinical
